   269|  {id:'em5',pipeline:'SaaS',day:5,subject:'"How long does setup take?" and other top questions',body:'Hi {{name}},\n\nBased on demos with business owners like you, here are the top questions we receive:\n\n1. "I\'m not technical — can I really set this up?"\nYes! Our onboarding specialists handle the technical setup. You focus on your content and clients.\n\n2. "How long until I\'m live?"\nMost clients launch their first offer within 4-6 weeks of starting.\n\n3. "What kind of support do you provide?"\n- Dedicated onboarding specialist (first 60 days)\n- Weekly group office hours\n- 24/7 ticket-based support\n- Ongoing strategy consultations available\n\n4. "Can I migrate from my current tools?"\nAbsolutely. We help migrate content, client data, and payment settings from platforms like Kajabi, Teachable, and Thinkific.\n\n5. "What if I want to change my offer later?"\nLaunchPad is designed for evolution. Update your content, pricing, or structure anytime — no developer needed.\n\nStill wondering if it\'s right for you? Let\'s talk:\n👉 [Book Your No-Pressure Consultation](https://mife.co/consult)',cta:'Book Your No-Pressure Consultation at https://mife.co/consult'},
