   273|  {id:'em8',pipeline:'Consulting',day:1,subject:'AI for {{company}}\'s operations — a thought',body:'Hi {{name}},\n\nI\'ve been following {{company}}\'s work — impressive growth and impact.\n\nI\'m reaching out because MIFECO has helped organizations like UC Berkeley and IBM Watson implement AI strategies that reduced operational overhead by 40-60% while improving service delivery.\n\nQuick context on MIFECO:\n- 30+ years of consulting experience\n- Worked with UC Berkeley, IBM Watson, and major education technology platforms\n- Mars Society award-winning AI implementations\n- Authored "AI for Small Business: A Practical Playbook"\n\nI\'m not sure if {{company}} is actively exploring AI for internal operations, but if you are, I\'d love to share what we\'ve seen work for similar organizations.\n\nWould you be open to a brief conversation?\n\nBest,\n[Consultant Name]\nMIFECO Consulting\nmifeco.com',cta:'Reply to schedule a conversation'},
