   279|  {id:'em13',pipeline:'Books',day:1,subject:'Welcome to the world of No Blue Sky, {{name}}!',body:'Hi {{name}},\n\nWelcome! I\'m Bob Mills, and I\'m thrilled to have you here.\n\nWhether you\'re discovering the No Blue Sky series for the first time or you\'ve heard about it through fellow readers, you\'re in for a journey. I\'ve poured years of imagination, research, and heart into these stories — and I\'m so glad you\'re giving them a chance.\n\n📚 THE NO BLUE SKY SERIES (5 Volumes)\nA gripping science fiction saga that explores what happens when humanity reaches beyond the stars — and finds more questions than answers.\n\nVolume 1: No Blue Sky: Ignition — $9.99\nVolume 2: No Blue Sky: Ascent — $11.99\nVolume 3: No Blue Sky: Orbit — $12.99\nVolume 4: No Blue Sky: Horizon — $14.99\nVolume 5: No Blue Sky: Beyond — $14.99\n\n📖 STANDALONE TITLE\nTomorrow is Still Open — $19.99\n\nAll books are available individually with special bulk pricing for groups.\n\nReply to this email anytime if you have questions about the books, want signed copies, or need help choosing where to start. I read every message personally.\n\nHappy reading,\nBob Mills',cta:'Browse the Full Catalog — reply with "Catalog"'},
   280|  {id:'em14',pipeline:'Books',day:3,subject:'{{name}}, here\'s the story behind the story',body:'Hi {{name}},\n\nEvery book has a story behind it — and No Blue Sky is no exception.\n\nI didn\'t set out to write a five-volume science fiction series. It started with a single image that wouldn\'t leave my head: a person standing on an alien world, looking up at a sky that wasn\'t blue, feeling utterly alone yet strangely at peace.\n\nThat image became Ignition. And once I started writing, the story took on a life of its own. Characters appeared fully formed. Worlds built themselves.\n\nI wrote most of No Blue Sky early in the morning, before the day job started. Some chapters were rewritten a dozen times. Others poured out in one sitting.\n\nTomorrow is Still Open came from a different place entirely — quieter, more personal. It\'s the book I needed to write when I was figuring out how to start over.\n\n🎁 Reply with "SAMPLE" and I\'ll send you a free sample chapter from any book of your choice.\n\nMore soon,\nBob Mills',cta:'Get Your Free Sample Chapter — reply with "SAMPLE"'},
   281|  {id:'em15',pipeline:'Books',day:7,subject:'What readers are saying about No Blue Sky, {{name}}',body:'Hi {{name}},\n\nOne of the best parts of being an author is hearing from readers. Here\'s what people are saying:\n\n⭐ "Ignition grabbed me from the first page and didn\'t let go." — Amazon Review\n\n⭐ "I bought No Blue Sky: Ascent for my son and ended up reading the whole thing myself." — Sarah M.\n\n⭐ "Tomorrow is Still Open made me cry in the best way." — Goodreads Review\n\n⭐ "The world-building in this series is incredible. Each volume gets better." — David L.\n\n🏆 The No Blue Sky series has been featured in Indie Sci-Fi Monthly\'s "Best of the Year" roundup.\n\nEvery volume is available as a standalone read — you can jump in anywhere.\n\n📖 Start reading today!\n\nReply anytime with questions — I\'m here to help,\nBob Mills',cta:'Read the Reviews — reply with any questions'},
   282|  {id:'em16',pipeline:'Books',day:14,subject:'Last chance, {{name}} — limited-time offer inside',body:'Hi {{name}},\n\nThis is the last email in this series, and I want to make it worth your while.\n\nFor the next 7 days, I\'m offering a special limited-time discount on all titles:\n\n🎉 15% OFF any single book — just reply with "ORDER" and the title you want.\n\n📦 BULK PRICING:\n• 10–49 copies → 10% off (Small Group)\n• 50–199 copies → 20% off (Classroom Set)\n• 200–999 copies → 30% off (Institution Pack)\n• 1,000+ copies → 40% off (Wholesale)\n\nThese bulk discounts stack with the 15% limited-time offer.\n\nReply with "ORDER" and your quantity/titles, and I\'ll respond within 24 hours.\n\nThis offer expires in 7 days.\n\nWith gratitude,\nBob Mills',cta:'Claim Your 15% Discount Now — reply with "ORDER"'},
