      <button class="btn btn-delete" id="vmDeleteBtn">🗑 Delete</button>
      <button class="btn btn-cancel" id="vmCloseBtn">Close</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
// ============================================================
// DATA — Embedded from social-content-books.json (Books pipeline content)
// All content items are loaded as JS objects directly in this script.
// ============================================================

// LinkedIn Outreach Messages
const LINKEDIN_MSGS = [
  {id:'lm1',target_type:'saas_hypatia',subject:'Scaling {{company}}\'s engineering velocity with AI-augmented pipelines',body:'Hi {{name}},\n\nI came across {{company}} while researching SaaS platforms pushing the boundaries of AI-native development. Your engineering team is clearly building at a high velocity.\n\nAt MIFECO, we\'ve developed Hypatia — an AI-augmented pipeline engine purpose-built for SaaS teams that need to ship faster without accumulating technical debt. It integrates directly into your existing CI/CD workflow, providing automated code review, intelligent test generation, and deployment risk scoring. Our early adopters report 40% faster release cycles and a 60% reduction in production incidents.\n\nUnlike generic DevOps tooling, Hypatia learns your team\'s specific codebase patterns and architectural preferences, becoming more valuable over time. It\'s designed for exactly the kind of high-performance engineering culture you\'re cultivating at {{company}}.\n\nWould you be open to a brief 15-minute call next week to explore whether Hypatia could help your team maintain velocity as you scale?\n\nBest,\nBob\nMIFECO',keywords:['AI pipeline engine','SaaS engineering velocity','automated code review','CI/CD optimization','AI DevOps tool','Hypatia pipeline']},
  {id:'lm2',target_type:'saas_pma',subject:'Streamlining {{company}}\'s product-market alignment process',body:'Hi {{name}},\n\nI\'ve been impressed by {{company}}\'s trajectory in the SaaS space. As Head of Product, you know firsthand how challenging it is to maintain strong product-market alignment as you scale.\n\nThis is exactly why we built PMA at MIFECO — a Product-Market Alignment platform that helps product teams close the feedback loop between customer signals and roadmap decisions. It aggregates insights from support tickets, user interviews, NPS data, and usage analytics into a single prioritized view that connects directly to your product backlog.\n\nProduct leaders at scaling SaaS companies use PMA to cut feature waste by 35% and improve user adoption of new releases by 50%. Rather than relying on gut feel or fragmented data, you get a continuous, data-driven picture of what your market actually needs.\n\nI\'d love to show you how PMA works and discuss how it might fit {{company}}\'s product development rhythm. Could we schedule a 20-minute chat?\n\nBest,\nBob\nMIFECO',keywords:['product-market alignment','SaaS product management','customer feedback aggregation','roadmap prioritization','product analytics platform','PMA tool']},
  {id:'lm3',target_type:'saas_vibra',subject:'Helping {{company}} improve user retention through behavioral AI',body:'Hi {{name}},\n\n{{company}} is building something exciting in the SaaS space, and I can see you\'re thoughtful about product decisions that drive real user engagement.\n\nAt MIFECO, we created Vibra — a behavioral AI platform that helps SaaS companies understand why users stay, churn, or expand. Vibra analyzes session data, feature usage patterns, and onboarding flows to identify the exact moments that predict long-term retention. It then surfaces actionable interventions your team can implement immediately.\n\nFounders and product leaders at growth-stage companies use Vibra to reduce churn by 25-40% within the first 90 days. Unlike traditional analytics tools that just show you what happened, Vibra tells you what to do about it and measures the impact of each change.\n\nI think {{company}} would find Vibra particularly valuable given your growth trajectory. Would you be open to a quick demo next week?\n\nBest,\nBob\nMIFECO',keywords:['user retention AI','behavioral analytics SaaS','churn reduction platform','SaaS user engagement','AI retention tool','Vibra behavioral AI']},
  {id:'lm4',target_type:'consulting_199',subject:'A structured approach to {{company}}\'s next growth phase',body:'Hi {{name}},\n\nI\'ve been following {{company}} and I\'m genuinely impressed by what you\'re building. As a founder or leader at a growing company, I know your plate is full — every decision compounds.\n\nAt MIFECO, we offer a targeted $199 consulting engagement designed specifically for companies like {{company}}. Here\'s what it includes:\n\n1. A deep-dive analysis of your current operational and strategic landscape\n2. Prioritized recommendations for the highest-impact improvements\n3. A 30-day action plan with specific milestones\n4. A 60-minute strategy session to walk through everything\n\nThis isn\'t generic advice — it\'s a tailored engagement based on your specific market position, team structure, and growth goals. Past clients have used these sessions to identify critical bottlenecks, refine their go-to-market strategy, and unlock 20-30% efficiency gains.\n\nNo retainer, no long-term commitment — just actionable insights you can implement immediately.\n\nWould you be open to a brief call to see if this makes sense for {{company}}?\n\nBest,\nBob\nMIFECO',keywords:['consulting engagement','$199 strategy session','growth consulting','startup operations audit','business strategy consulting','affordable consulting']},
