  {id:'lm6',target_type:'consulting_transform',subject:'Transforming {{company}}\'s operations for the next growth frontier',body:'Hi {{name}},\n\nI\'ve been watching {{company}}\'s journey — it\'s clear you\'re at an exciting inflection point. The companies that navigate these transitions best build scalable operational foundations before they absolutely need them.\n\nMIFECO\'s Transformation consulting is our flagship engagement: a full-spectrum operational overhaul covering strategic planning and OKR alignment, process reengineering with measurable efficiency targets, technology modernization including AI integration, team structure redesign, and change management to ensure adoption.\n\nOur clients typically see 50-80% higher operational throughput and 20-35% cost reduction while building the muscle to scale 3x without proportional headcount growth.\n\nFor a company like {{company}} with your trajectory, this could accelerate your entire growth plan. Are you open to a conversation about what this might look like for your team?\n\nBest,\nBob\nMIFECO',keywords:['business transformation consulting','operational overhaul','scale readiness consulting','AI transformation services','strategic operations consulting','MIFECO transformation']}
