  {id:'x1',book:'No Blue Sky: Built from Dust',copy:'Three ships. No return plan. 730 days of air, and it\'s already leaking.\n\nNo Blue Sky: Built from Dust isn\'t about saving humanity. It\'s about whether a handful of engineers can improvise a civilization from scratch — before their own life support fails.\n\nBob Mills spent decades designing systems for Fermilab and high-energy physics. This isn\'t fantasy. This is survival engineering on a deadline.\n\n☄️ First contact isn\'t aliens. It\'s rust. Read Book 1 of the No Blue Sky series.\n\n🔗 https://mifeco.io/books',hashtags:'#NoBlueSky #BuiltFromDust #MarsColony #HardSciFi #SpaceEngineering #MIFECO #BobMills #MartianSurvival #SciFiBooks #IndieAuthor',graphic_prompt:'Close-up of gloved hand pressing against cracked viewport glass on a Mars habitat'},
